'''Sensu Común''' ({{Literally|common sense}}) is a reformist [[W:Platformism|platform]] in the [[Balisca|Baliscan Confederation]]. It split from the [[Reformist Bloc (Balisca)|Reformist Bloc]] during the [[2021 Baliscan civil unrest]].
